# Play test of Driftwood Key (CIPlay driftwood_key, in a test world 'CI ...'). No quest: the fisherman's cabin, his box.
# Points as in its recipe.
island Driftwood Key
offset 0 0
expect animals Stingray 2
wait 3
# In at the cabin's door
walk -2.25 -6 to -2.25 -4 to -2.25 -1.5 h=2.3 below=3
expect stand -2.25 -1.5 h=2.3 below=3
open Fisherman's box
